What is printed by the following constructor chaining program?

```java
class DeviceConfig {
    String mode = "Standard";
    int level = 1;
    DeviceConfig(String m) {
        this(m, 10);
        this.mode = m + "-Custom";
    }
    DeviceConfig(String m, int lvl) {
        this.level = lvl * 2;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        DeviceConfig config = new DeviceConfig("Pro");
        System.out.println(config.mode + " " + config.level);
    }
}
```

