Analyze constructor delegation and inheritance in this snippet. What is printed?

```java
class BaseWorker {
    String title;
    BaseWorker(String t) {
        this.title = t;
    }
}
class LeadWorker extends BaseWorker {
    int teamSize;
    LeadWorker(String t) {
        this.teamSize = 1;
        this.title = t;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        LeadWorker lead = new LeadWorker("TechLead");
        System.out.println(lead.title + " " + lead.teamSize);
    }
}
```
